  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secondment to EEAS StratCom Western Balkans Task Force</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sekondering till EEAS StraCom V&#xe4;stra Balkan Task Force</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EEAS StratCom Task Force p&#xe5; v&#xe4;stra Balkan har till uppgift att effektivt kommunicera och fr&#xe4;mja EU:s politik gentemot v&#xe4;stra Balkan. St&#xe4;rka den &#xf6;vergripande mediemilj&#xf6;n p&#xe5; v&#xe4;stra Balkan, inklusive st&#xf6;d till mediefrihet och st&#xe4;rka oberoende medier och f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad EU-kapacitet att prognostisera, adressera och reagera p&#xe5; disinformationaktiviteter fr&#xe5;n externa akt&#xf6;rer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EEAS StratCom Western Balkans Task Force is tasked with effective communication and promotion of EU policies towards the Western Balkans; Strengthening the overall media environmen in the Western Balkans, including support for media freedom and strenghthening independent meda; and improved EU capaciry to forecast, address and respond to disinformation activities by external actors.</narrative>
  </description>
